<title>THAILAND: Thai bourse halts trade in brokers SCF, SCCF.</title>
<headline>Thai bourse halts trade in brokers SCF, SCCF.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai stock exchange halted trading in the shares of SCF Finance and Securities and Siam City Credit Finance and Securities Plc on Tuesday morning.</p>
<p>The exchange said it was awaiting a disclosure regarding a proposed merger between the two firms.</p>
<p>SCF shares were halted at 12.50 baht and SCCF shares were trading at 17.50.</p>
<p>The companies are affiliates of Siam City Bank Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642, email: bangkok.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
